'''Mimikyu''' (Japanese: '''ミミッキュ''' ''Mimikkyu'') is a {{ct|Psychic}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Eevee Grove}} expansion.

