==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Eevee Grove}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Team Up|Mimikyu|112}} from the {{TCG|Team Up}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Cosmic Eclipse|Mimikyu|97}} from the {{TCG|Cosmic Eclipse}} expansion.
*'''Try to Imitate''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Destined Rivals|Ethan's Sudowoodo|93}} from the {{TCG|Destined Rivals}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

